            <p>Endoscopy View From Sialendoscopy. The image shows&#x000a0;the interior of the submandibular duct, showing a smooth ductal wall with a visible intraductal stone causing partial obstruction. Iowa Head and Neck Protocols, Carver College of Medicine, University of Iowa</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Iowa__protoc__image2" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
