          <caption>
            <p>Submandibular Gland Resection. Intraoperative view showing the submandibular gland with identification of the marginal mandibular branch and cervical branches of the facial nerve. The main trunk of the facial nerve and the retromandibular vein are also visible. Iowa Head and Neck Protocols, Carver College of Medicine, University of Iowa</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Screenshot__2025-07-07__at__8.43.54xPM__x1x" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
